 736:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/syspm/cy_syspm.h **** *     </td>
 737:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/syspm/cy_syspm.h **** *     <td>Callback mechanism enhancements</td>
